schema. Verification: actual typed OP/AC requests validated by the maintained
check-jsonschema CLI, negative schema cases, native wire/API tests and full
LU/Faer original replay. Other historical advanced-model schema gaps remain
outside this slice; no full schema/API conformance is inferred.
